      "writtenOn": "2026-03-11T18:53:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I chose this arbitrarily, mostly because I thought it would easily distinguish wasm vs native artifacts by filename. It\u0027s not actually required AFAIK.\n\nFor example, the libraries in emscripten\u0027s sysroot are all shipped named just `.a`, e.g: `emscripten/cache/sysroot/lib/wasm32-emscripten/libwebgpu.a`. So we could either drop the custom naming entirely, or we could do e.g. `.wasm.a` (which I personally think reads a little better than `.wasma`).",
      "parentUuid": "73f5cdef_b86f240a",
